  "contentHtml": "\n<div><!--IMG1--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/12/76525802.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120310211117im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/12/s76525802.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG1--><br>The Catabombs хэмээх газар нь Парисийн алдартай оршуулгийн газарын нэг юм. Уг газар нь&nbsp; газар доогуур байрлагдсан оршуулгийн газар нь Roman эрин үед шохойн чулуугаар баригдсан гэгддэг аж. Дээхэн үед тахал тархсан учир уг оршуулгын газрыг газар доор байрлуулсан гэдэг юм байна. Энэхүү газар нь The Catacombs гэдгээрээ алдартай.<br><!--IMG2--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/12/29378278.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120310211117im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/12/s29378278.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG2--><br><!--IMG3--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/12/41390730.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120310211117im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/12/s41390730.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG3--><br><!--IMG4--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/12/59828861.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120310211117im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/12/s59828861.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG4--><br><!--IMG5--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120310211117im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/12/30393419.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG5--><br><!--IMG6--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120310211117im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/12/26610145.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG6--><br><!--IMG7--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/12/76696433.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120310211117im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/12/s76696433.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG7--><br><!--IMG8--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/12/70523346.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120310211117im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/12/s70523346.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG8--><br></div>",
